POST {{baseUrl}}/api/customers
Content-Type: application/json

[]

### 34 — JSON rusak: error parser, bukan error database (400)
# @expect 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "JSON sengaja rusak",

